WEBVTT

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:05.980
The moon.

00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:15.160
So another aristocrat became a Horror.

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:19.030
Does it have to do with the fact that the moon has turned crimson?

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:26.600
There are many who believe the red moon may be ominous...

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:29.440
An unusual moon is an interesting one.

00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:38.610
Seimei, it's true that humans are weak.

00:00:38.610 --> 00:00:43.020
That is why they continue to create darkness and turn into Horrors.

00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:48.620
You may not be able to forgive such weakness, but...

00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:51.290
Even so, I will protect the people.

00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:57.490
If I meet you again, this time...

00:01:22.290 --> 00:01:26.060
Again, embers of red rise up to the sky.

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:30.000
No matter how many times
I see it, it's quite unnerving.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.400
It's like the world is ending.

00:01:47.480 --> 00:01:49.650
Raiko-<i>sama</i>, did you see that?!

00:01:49.650 --> 00:01:54.920
Yeah. It's the same symbol that Seimei uses.

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:56.930
Why did that appear on the moon?!

00:01:56.930 --> 00:02:00.300
Either way, this is serious!

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:04.930
Argh! If only Seimei was here now!

00:02:04.930 --> 00:02:08.200
I-I'm very sorry, Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:02:08.870 --> 00:02:10.930
Don't worry about it, Kintoki.

00:02:13.640 --> 00:02:15.270
Seimei...

00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:25.950
<i>The white lotus flower blooms</i>

00:02:27.320 --> 00:02:32.660
<i>The key to the bright night sky appears</i>

00:02:32.660 --> 00:02:38.300
<i>And now the hazy barrier fades away</i>

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:43.540
<i>The unstoppable fate of time</i>

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:48.000
<i>The ever repeating link</i>

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:55.650
<i>Madder red clouds are swallowed up by darkness</i>

00:02:55.650 --> 00:03:00.890
<i>Swirling desire gives it strength</i>

00:03:00.890 --> 00:03:06.950
<i>A darkness that even provokes this love</i>

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:08.900
<i>Quick as lightning</i>

00:03:08.900 --> 00:03:12.000
<i>Illusions, show your true form</i>

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:17.210
<i>Sky, storm violently</i>

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:22.840
<i>As the fang of steel shines with a golden gleam</i>

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:32.840
<i>Why do people yearn for love so much</i> <i>their souls become dyed with crimson?</i>

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:38.890
<i>Protect it to the end!</i>

00:03:38.890 --> 00:03:41.600
<i>Toward the light of the pure white lotus.</i>

00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:45.870
<i>AH... GARO</i>

00:03:53.140 --> 00:03:56.540
We'll have you tell us today!

00:03:56.540 --> 00:04:00.150
Goodness. Such an obstinate little bean.

00:04:00.150 --> 00:04:03.120
Yes I am! You know something, don't you?!

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:06.390
Inari-<i>sama</i>. Something unusual happened with the moon last night.

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:09.160
The object up in the sky right now.

00:04:09.160 --> 00:04:12.990
It seems like a moon, but it is not.

00:04:12.990 --> 00:04:15.130
It is called the Crimson Moon.

00:04:15.130 --> 00:04:19.230
Long ago, a highly talented alchemist from the Abe family...

00:04:19.230 --> 00:04:23.270
Created that barrier to seal away a catastrophe.

00:04:23.270 --> 00:04:26.170
In other words, a phantom moon.

00:04:26.170 --> 00:04:28.310
I-Is that true?!

00:04:28.310 --> 00:04:31.580
Why did you stay quiet about something that important?!

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:32.250
Ow!

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:37.250
The "key" has already been used by someone to open the seal.

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:40.760
We had sent knights and alchemists to other lands

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:44.630
to secretly look for that lost key.

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:49.000
Is that why there are no other knights in the capital?

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:51.130
Right, for that very reason.

00:04:51.130 --> 00:04:54.340
You're sharp, unlike the Kintoki bean there.

00:04:54.340 --> 00:04:56.900
S-So, what is that barrier--

00:04:56.900 --> 00:04:58.870
Ow! Ow!

00:04:58.870 --> 00:05:01.480
There is no need for you to know.

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:05.510
More like we can't tell you without permission.

00:05:05.510 --> 00:05:08.280
Orders from above us.

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:11.190
So that's it for today.

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:14.660
This is not a simple matter.

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:19.820
We also hope this problem is resolved without complication.

00:05:53.590 --> 00:05:55.000
Oh?

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:57.660
Well, well. An unexpected guest.

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:05.270
I've finally found you, Douman.

00:06:05.270 --> 00:06:07.070
Where is Douma Houshi?

00:06:10.950 --> 00:06:14.550
You have no intention of answering, huh?

00:06:14.550 --> 00:06:17.950
Then I'll beat the answer out of you!

00:06:19.890 --> 00:06:21.050
Shallow!

00:06:23.590 --> 00:06:26.590
Your impatience blinds you to your surroundings.

00:06:26.590 --> 00:06:28.230
I pity you.

00:06:28.230 --> 00:06:29.600
What did you say?!

00:06:29.600 --> 00:06:32.970
I am saying that I am not your opponent.

00:06:32.970 --> 00:06:34.800
Look, here he comes!

00:06:39.470 --> 00:06:41.140
So I didn't stop him in time.

00:06:44.610 --> 00:06:45.910
Wait!

00:06:52.820 --> 00:06:54.220
I won't let you get away!

00:07:32.190 --> 00:07:36.010
Someone like me, making a mistake like this.

00:07:37.520 --> 00:07:39.670
So impudent!

00:07:39.670 --> 00:07:41.640
You're just a small fry!

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:48.210
You're an evil spirit that eats humans, right?

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:56.220
Then, just try and eat me!

00:07:56.220 --> 00:07:57.950
Come on! Come on!

00:08:04.560 --> 00:08:07.120
Raiko-<i>sama</i>! Over there!

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:11.070
It's a Horror!

00:08:11.070 --> 00:08:14.240
We weren't mistaken, after all.

00:08:14.240 --> 00:08:15.640
Yeah.

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:17.800
Though, it looked like it was chasing someone?

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:20.370
Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:08:20.370 --> 00:08:22.370
Yeah, let's take it down at once.

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:44.830
Red light.

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:47.000
As creepy as usual.

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:51.340
It's as if the moon is devouring those lights.

00:08:55.340 --> 00:08:57.070
Raiko...

00:09:10.930 --> 00:09:13.900
Looks like I'm the pathetic one.

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:16.860
Don't falter.

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:21.460
I've always ended up alone. Isn't that right?

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:27.040
I lost my father. I lost my mother.

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:31.050
I tossed aside my family and my name.

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:37.140
When I thought I found a teacher, we went our different ways.

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:43.220
And then I found a light.

00:09:43.220 --> 00:09:47.960
Was that light just a momentary illusion?

00:09:51.630 --> 00:09:55.610
I'm undeserving of that sparkle...

00:09:57.670 --> 00:10:03.480
There was no way that
I could stay beside him forever.

00:10:36.010 --> 00:10:37.480
Where am I?

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:44.390
Wh-Who is it?! Where are you?

00:10:44.390 --> 00:10:45.820
Come out!

00:10:47.860 --> 00:10:54.800
The darkness has already awoken.
There is nowhere for you to run.

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:57.030
Wh-What are you saying?

00:11:06.070 --> 00:11:09.880
Be afraid. Fall into despair.

00:11:09.880 --> 00:11:14.820
Your body and your soul. All of it is mine.

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:18.150
Don't joke around! Show yourself!

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:23.390
Mine. Mine. Mine.

00:11:23.390 --> 00:11:26.060
No! No! No!

00:11:26.060 --> 00:11:27.550
No!

00:11:33.200 --> 00:11:36.070
Did you have a bad dream?

00:11:36.070 --> 00:11:38.440
You were moaning quite a lot.

00:11:38.440 --> 00:11:41.010
Eavesdropping on a sleeping woman.

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:43.580
That's a bad habit for an <i>onmyou</i> professor like yourself.

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:46.850
Now is not the time to talk back so insolently.

00:11:46.850 --> 00:11:50.580
You are currently cursed by Douma Houshi.

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:53.920
Is that not so?

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:02.700
I heard from Raiko-<i>dono</i> and Yorinobu-<i>dono</i>

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:07.540
about your disappearance from the capital.

00:12:07.540 --> 00:12:12.370
I never expected you to come to this land to purify your body.

00:12:14.640 --> 00:12:16.910
Why are you here, Grandfather?

00:12:18.480 --> 00:12:21.650
This is the holy mountain of the Abe family,

00:12:21.650 --> 00:12:24.150
where your mother and father both slept.

00:12:24.150 --> 00:12:26.780
It is not strange for me to be here.

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:35.250
I came to this place for a certain reason.

00:12:42.800 --> 00:12:46.430
This is the place where we watch over the Crimson Moon.

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:51.610
It has been passed down the
Abe family from generation to generation.

00:12:54.520 --> 00:12:58.750
This, is the Crimson Moon?

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:03.660
A barrier used to seal away catastrophe.

00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:06.960
But the seal has been broken.

00:13:06.960 --> 00:13:09.430
At this rate <i>it</i> will resurrect.

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:11.270
It?

00:13:11.270 --> 00:13:13.030
Rudra.

00:13:13.030 --> 00:13:18.170
Ancient Makai Knights and
Alchemists were unable to defeat it.

00:13:18.170 --> 00:13:20.980
A Horror with unimaginable power.

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:25.710
In the past, a great catastrophe occurred because of it.

00:13:25.710 --> 00:13:29.620
It was an event that happened long before the existence of the capital.

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:33.020
The Horrors that appear in the capital are probably stronger

00:13:33.020 --> 00:13:36.720
due to Rudra's influence.

00:13:36.720 --> 00:13:43.730
That is why I have come to look for the key that had kept Rudra sealed.

00:13:43.730 --> 00:13:48.740
If we use that key, we can restore the seal on Rudra.

00:13:48.740 --> 00:13:50.740
Correct.

00:13:50.740 --> 00:13:53.230
But, before that.

00:13:56.810 --> 00:13:58.380
What's the meaning of this?!

00:13:58.380 --> 00:14:01.750
I will remove the curse on you now.

00:14:13.090 --> 00:14:15.600
If you use a spell like this...

00:14:15.600 --> 00:14:17.360
Grandfather, your life!

00:14:26.370 --> 00:14:27.710
Kiyome.

00:14:31.050 --> 00:14:33.280
Stop!

00:14:33.280 --> 00:14:35.920
Kiyome, do not give up yet.

00:14:35.920 --> 00:14:38.020
I will be sure to save you!

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:39.590
Shut up!

00:14:39.590 --> 00:14:41.750
Just try and do it, old man.

00:14:45.090 --> 00:14:48.550
Grandfather, please kill me!

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:13.950
I did not make it in time.

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:25.600
You'll be sure to do what, again?

00:15:25.600 --> 00:15:27.730
Hey, Grandfather.

00:15:42.850 --> 00:15:46.450
What... What was I trying to do?!

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:52.220
If Shiki didn't stop me...

00:15:52.220 --> 00:15:55.330
That's right, if it's him...

00:15:55.330 --> 00:15:57.320
He'll be able to help me!

00:16:01.640 --> 00:16:03.440
Hurry!

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:08.610
I don't have much time left!

00:16:08.610 --> 00:16:11.440
Douma!

00:16:15.520 --> 00:16:18.120
You've finally appeared.

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:21.660
I've been waiting for you, Seimei.

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:25.060
You knew and made me chase after you.

00:16:25.060 --> 00:16:29.300
So everything has happened according to your plans.

00:16:29.300 --> 00:16:31.470
Answer me, Douma!

00:16:31.470 --> 00:16:36.000
You are the one who released the seal of the Crimson Moon, right?!

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:37.810
What would you do if that were the case?

00:16:37.810 --> 00:16:41.180
Tell me how to re-lock the seal with the key.

00:16:41.180 --> 00:16:42.880
If you do not...

00:16:42.880 --> 00:16:45.210
You plan to kill us.

00:16:45.210 --> 00:16:47.840
I see, that is fine as well.

00:16:50.020 --> 00:16:55.660
Even if you kill me, the curse upon you will not disappear.

00:16:55.660 --> 00:16:59.490
You can no longer escape.

00:16:59.490 --> 00:17:03.400
I do not mind. I have strayed from the path many times.

00:17:04.770 --> 00:17:07.670
This is an end I deserve.

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:11.370
But, I will take the two of you down with me!

00:17:11.370 --> 00:17:13.200
Wonderful.

00:17:14.410 --> 00:17:17.340
The clashing of light and darkness.

00:17:17.340 --> 00:17:23.950
Once they pass the critical point, your power as an <i>onmyou</i> will peak.

00:17:23.950 --> 00:17:29.420
It is a power unobtainable by a
Makai Knight with no doubt in his heart.

00:17:29.420 --> 00:17:33.390
Seimei, your opponent will be this man.

00:17:33.390 --> 00:17:35.420
Ashiya Douman.

00:17:37.230 --> 00:17:40.370
If you wish to know about the seal of the Crimson Moon,

00:17:40.370 --> 00:17:42.530
you must defeat me!

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:50.070
Yeah, I'll do just that.
We'll definitely end things today.

00:17:56.450 --> 00:17:57.580
Douman!

00:17:57.580 --> 00:18:00.320
Why do you follow Douma's orders?

00:18:00.320 --> 00:18:02.760
Humans cannot control Horrors!

00:18:02.760 --> 00:18:07.260
If Rudra resurrects, you and Douma will also be devoured!

00:18:07.260 --> 00:18:09.630
That is my wish!

00:18:11.770 --> 00:18:15.570
I will change this place into a lifeless and lightless world!

00:18:18.170 --> 00:18:24.310
That will be the moment
I finally get my revenge on that man.

00:18:24.310 --> 00:18:28.450
That man? You've said that before.

00:18:28.450 --> 00:18:31.980
Could you be talking about Michinaga?

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:45.760
I cannot let things end like this!

00:18:48.970 --> 00:18:53.610
If I give in, Raiko will...

00:18:58.150 --> 00:19:00.610
How do you still have that much power?!

00:19:24.840 --> 00:19:26.700
A futile struggle.

00:19:33.650 --> 00:19:36.020
She has finally awakened.

00:19:37.920 --> 00:19:41.660
It seems your long desired wish has come true.

00:19:41.660 --> 00:19:45.090
What do you plan to do now?

00:19:45.090 --> 00:19:50.260
We need to test its strength while it is inside the vessel.

00:19:50.260 --> 00:19:54.000
The only thing inside this Seimei is darkness.

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:58.840
The darkness we yearn for is right before our eyes.

00:19:58.840 --> 00:20:04.750
It would be interesting to have her go against the Makai Knights immediately.

00:20:04.750 --> 00:20:09.750
No, wait. We should keep her sealed until we find the key.

00:20:09.750 --> 00:20:13.020
I have a better idea.

00:20:13.020 --> 00:20:13.950
What is that?

00:20:13.950 --> 00:20:20.230
I will obtain this power and become darkness itself.

00:20:20.230 --> 00:20:20.960
Wait!

00:20:20.960 --> 00:20:25.300
I told you before.
You will not be able to return.

00:20:25.300 --> 00:20:30.240
Do not worry. I do not have any plans to return.

00:20:30.240 --> 00:20:33.270
Only darkness stands before me.

00:20:33.270 --> 00:20:36.610
I have never once yearned for the light.

00:20:36.610 --> 00:20:40.550
You know what lies there.

00:20:40.550 --> 00:20:44.580
It is impossible to control.
You will be devoured!

00:20:45.490 --> 00:20:49.390
I will devour it first.

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:53.260
It seems my words no longer reach you.

00:20:53.260 --> 00:20:57.290
There was no need for discussion to begin with.

00:21:05.270 --> 00:21:08.740
As expected of my teacher.

00:21:08.740 --> 00:21:12.850
Using dice to control the sum of all things.

00:21:12.850 --> 00:21:15.950
It is the essence of my spells.

00:21:15.950 --> 00:21:17.650
Fall, Douman.

00:21:17.650 --> 00:21:22.790
At the very least,
I will make your death an instant one!

00:21:22.790 --> 00:21:28.550
No. You are the one who is fated to be swallowed by the darkness!

00:21:30.460 --> 00:21:34.030
Farewell, previous Ashiya Douman.

00:21:34.030 --> 00:21:35.660
Bastard!

00:21:39.670 --> 00:21:40.870
Finally.

00:21:40.870 --> 00:21:42.470
It has awakened.

00:21:44.950 --> 00:21:46.380
Rudra!

00:21:59.230 --> 00:22:01.790
Raiko-<i>sama</i>. What was that?!

00:22:53.180 --> 00:23:01.090
<i>Whilst looking at the filling moon</i>

00:23:01.090 --> 00:23:11.090
<i>Today, as well, I bury these growing feelings</i>

00:23:11.200 --> 00:23:18.240
<i>The skies of fate have split in two</i>

00:23:18.240 --> 00:23:24.240
<i>(Shine upon the darkness) Lead me</i>

00:23:25.710 --> 00:23:30.580
<i>Yearning for the light, I throw out my heart</i>

00:23:30.580 --> 00:23:35.720
<i>I will always be beside you</i>

00:23:35.720 --> 00:23:42.350
<i>So until the last moment of this life</i>

00:23:42.350 --> 00:23:47.560
<i>Let me see this fleeting dream</i>

00:23:52.390 --> 00:23:54.460
A dark roar.

00:23:54.460 --> 00:23:57.030
Crumbling chains.

00:23:57.030 --> 00:24:00.630
Lightning that becomes stained with red.
